"a Hugo site on GitHub Pages, answered by a Cloudflare Worker.

  created    ondocs-worker/package.json    the Worker’s dependencies and scripts
  created    ondocs-worker/tsconfig.json   TypeScript for the Worker, with the Workers runtime types
  created    ondocs-worker/wrangler.jsonc  the Worker’s configuration, with the site’s URL
